<title>USA: M/I Schottenstein says sees good 1997.</title>
<headline>M/I Schottenstein says sees good 1997.</headline>
<dateline>COLUMBUS, Ohio 1997-05-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>M/I Schottenstein said it expects a good year in 1997.</p>
<p>&quot;Our Columbus, Raleigh, Maryland and M/I Financial operations had very strong first quarter results, and with our $308,000,000 March 31 backlog, we look for solid 1997 results,&quot; said Irving Schottenstein, chief executive officer.</p>
</text>
